Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:18:24 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1413/1463] HERESY 1460: the Refiner's steps of one's own: a
 plugin's step after the studio's, its panel drawn from what it says, its
 branch in the tree
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 15.10.2026: «написать всё как единый плагин, который мы не выложим в паблик, но он будет висеть у меня в пайплайне». The page asks the lab which plugins the studio has (GET /lab/plugins: user/plugins/*/plugin.json, lab/plugins.py) and puts each plugin's step after the studio's own in the Refiner's row, marked by a dashed edge; its panel is drawn from what the plugin says: a source (the take or a file of its tree) and its fields (a number in its bounds, a choice, a box), Run asks POST /lab/plugin/run and says when it is in the tree. The tree heads a plugin's branch with its own name and fields; its files play, compare (Compare all too), lie over the spectrum and serve as a source; its step is ticked. Without a plugin nothing changes. Four new strings in all eleven catalogs. Kitchen suite 820/0 (one new check, the lab mocked).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
